            <button onclick="toggleCartDrawer()" style="background: #f1f5f9; border: none; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">✕</button>
